The '''Mossgrove Farm''' is an abandoned farmland located on the hills across below from [[Stillward Church]] in [[Gilneas]]. The Mossgrove family is no longer present on their farmland, its sole inhabitant being [[Aliattan Anderson]], who was seeking refuge away from his haunting by one of the [[Widows of the Wood]].

